From 2324e00311c0b3326be4389f2905fed270298864 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim Yu <yunicorn@google.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Apr 2024 18:18:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [RESTRICT AUTOMERGE] Fix Autofill Inflating as User 0

Autofill will inflate views as the current foreground user instead of
the system_server user (0).

Bug: 327137311
Test: atest CtsAutoFillServiceTestCases --user-type secondary_user
Flag: EXEMPT security bug fix
Change-Id: I8a2c96259976e61d297dec914d10d86e585a6d6f
---
 .../com/android/server/autofill/Helper.java   | 24 +++++++++++++
 .../com/android/server/autofill/Session.java  | 34 +++++++++++++------
 .../server/autofill/ui/DialogFillUi.java      | 10 ++++--
 .../android/server/autofill/ui/FillUi.java    | 13 ++++---
 .../android/server/autofill/ui/SaveUi.java    |  5 ++-
 5 files changed, 68 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

